{"4467600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Z Drive", "steam_appid": 4467600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467600/extras/d031e294a6016b8e4689323e4410a5c3.avif?t=1779712257\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DRIVE INTO THE SEALED LANDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twenty years ago, strange plants rose from the ground and spread across entire regions. At first, people did not understand the danger. Soon the plants began to change those who came too close, turning them into something no longer human. Cities tried to burn the infected areas, but in some places the growth always returned. Massive walls were built to seal the zones away from the rest of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, two decades later, you choose to enter one of these forbidden territories. No one forced you. Whatever you are searching for lies somewhere inside the walls — in a place long abandoned, where nature and horror have grown together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVAL IS A CHOICE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is tense and resources are limited. Weapons and ammunition are never guaranteed, and every encounter can cost you more than you expect. Searching abandoned houses, industrial sites, and forgotten checkpoints is the only way to stay prepared, but the infected are never far away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival in the zone is not about strength. It is about careful planning, smart inventory management, and knowing when to fight — and when to leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467600/extras/8df8ae8aae39504b022c00ca1b3f9c0e.poster.avif?t=1779712257\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467600/extras/8df8ae8aae39504b022c00ca1b3f9c0e.webm?t=1779712257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467600/extras/8df8ae8aae39504b022c00ca1b3f9c0e.mp4?t=1779712257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR ONLY PARTNER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your car is your lifeline. It allows you to cross large distances, escape danger, and carry the supplies you need to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it requires constant attention — fuel runs low, parts wear down, and damaged wheels can leave you stranded in the worst possible place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467600/extras/6724cac587753852852717f3015feee3.poster.avif?t=1779712257\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467600/extras/6724cac587753852852717f3015feee3.webm?t=1779712257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467600/extras/6724cac587753852852717f3015feee3.mp4?t=1779712257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD TO STAY ALIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered across the ruins you will find metal and machine parts left behind by the old world. Using a 3D printer, you can turn raw materials into tools for survival — from weapons and ammunition to car parts and essential equipment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you gather enough resources, almost anything can be created.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467600/extras/66f19256e1f1a67aec5c433eaf567b74.poster.avif?t=1779712257\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467600/extras/66f19256e1f1a67aec5c433eaf567b74.webm?t=1779712257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467600/extras/66f19256e1f1a67aec5c433eaf567b74.mp4?t=1779712257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467600/extras/d031e294a6016b8e4689323e4410a5c3.avif?t=1779712257\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DRIVE INTO THE SEALED LANDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twenty years ago, strange plants rose from the ground and spread across entire regions. At first, people did not understand the danger. Soon the plants began to change those who came too close, turning them into something no longer human. Cities tried to burn the infected areas, but in some places the growth always returned. Massive walls were built to seal the zones away from the rest of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, two decades later, you choose to enter one of these forbidden territories. No one forced you. Whatever you are searching for lies somewhere inside the walls — in a place long abandoned, where nature and horror have grown together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVAL IS A CHOICE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is tense and resources are limited. Weapons and ammunition are never guaranteed, and every encounter can cost you more than you expect. Searching abandoned houses, industrial sites, and forgotten checkpoints is the only way to stay prepared, but the infected are never far away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival in the zone is not about strength. It is about careful planning, smart inventory management, and knowing when to fight — and when to leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467600/extras/8df8ae8aae39504b022c00ca1b3f9c0e.poster.avif?t=1779712257\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467600/extras/8df8ae8aae39504b022c00ca1b3f9c0e.webm?t=1779712257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467600/extras/8df8ae8aae39504b022c00ca1b3f9c0e.mp4?t=1779712257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR ONLY PARTNER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your car is your lifeline. It allows you to cross large distances, escape danger, and carry the supplies you need to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it requires constant attention — fuel runs low, parts wear down, and damaged wheels can leave you stranded in the worst possible place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467600/extras/6724cac587753852852717f3015feee3.poster.avif?t=1779712257\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467600/extras/6724cac587753852852717f3015feee3.webm?t=1779712257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467600/extras/6724cac587753852852717f3015feee3.mp4?t=1779712257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD TO STAY ALIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered across the ruins you will find metal and machine parts left behind by the old world. Using a 3D printer, you can turn raw materials into tools for survival — from weapons and ammunition to car parts and essential equipment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you gather enough resources, almost anything can be created.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467600/extras/66f19256e1f1a67aec5c433eaf567b74.poster.avif?t=1779712257\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467600/extras/66f19256e1f1a67aec5c433eaf567b74.webm?t=1779712257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467600/extras/66f19256e1f1a67aec5c433eaf567b74.mp4?t=1779712257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Drive, explore, search for resources, and craft! And drive! Do it for as long as you can! This FPS takes place in a rough world after a zombie attack. Prepare your wheeled fortress for every possible adventure! Explore the dead world and search for the remnants of civilization.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467600/cffbd89c61feecc0e536d6e8bfdd8f02784eaada/header.jpg?t=1779712257", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467600/081e05318b79e6da514740dec1bec83c56c40ca2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779712257", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467600/081e05318b79e6da514740dec1bec83c56c40ca2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779712257", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit or later<br></li><